    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Plant up to four arrows or bolts (two more per slot level above 2nd) in your space for 8 hours. Whenever an enemy enters a space within 30 ft of them for the first time on a turn or ends its turn there, one flies up: DEX save or 2d4 Piercing damage, and that piece is used up (counted automatically). The spell ends when none remain. Creatures you choose (your allies) are ignored.</p>",
